OL,3,AYoung people describe 'losing hope' and
OL,4,Abusinesses 'squeezed' as government
OL,5,Abacks plans to tackle Neets crisis
OL,6,
OL,7,FA review into UK youth unemployment
OL,8,Fproposes changes to tax, welfare and
OL,9,Feducation to help get 440,000 young
OL,10,Fpeople into work by 2036 - here are the
OL,11,Fkey figures
OL,13,FAndy Burnham wants the report, by
OL,14,Fformer minister Alan Milburn, to be a
OL,15,F"watershed moment in how we think about
OL,16,Fwelfare and how we support young
OL,17,Fpeople", No 10 says
OL,19,FMilburn suggests businesses should be
OL,20,Ftaxed less for employing young people,
OL,21,Fand the number of apprenticeships
OL,22,Fshould double
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
