OL,3,AYoung people describe 'losing hope' and
OL,4,Abusinesses 'squeezed' as government
OL,5,Abacks plans to tackle Neets crisis
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Conservatives say the "lion's
OL,8,Fshare" of what's recommended is a
OL,9,F"massive spending plan"
OL,11,FFfion, 24, tells us she is "losing
OL,12,Fhope" after applying for 100 jobs since
OL,13,FJune and getting just three interviews,
OL,14,Fwhile cafe owner Ben worries about the
OL,15,Fcosts of taking on young people: "Our
OL,16,Fmargins have been squeezed and squeezed
OL,17,Fand squeezed"
